# No hand-drawn SVGs

Never create custom inline SVG paths, icons, or decorative illustrations for UI.

## Instead

- Use **Font Awesome** (already on calculator/toolbox pages): `<i class="fas fa-..."></i>`
- Reuse existing site images and icon patterns from `style.css`
- Ask the user for an asset, or use a proper icon library / licensed illustration

## Do not

- Hand-write `<svg><path d="M12 3 L8 11...">` style icons
- Generate "quick" vector art for cards, badges, or section headers

If SVG is truly required (logo, chart, map), use an established library, a designer-provided file, or code-generated geometry with clear specs — not improvised paths.
